WEBVTT

00:00.930 --> 00:02.690
How could this happen?

00:04.070 --> 00:08.520
First, they targeted Mother,
and then Sisbell...

00:09.290 --> 00:11.440
Thank you for your efforts, Alice.

00:13.050 --> 00:16.080
You did well to protect Sisbell.

00:16.080 --> 00:17.760
Mother?

00:18.310 --> 00:19.800
That's...

00:19.800 --> 00:22.090
I'm here now!

00:22.480 --> 00:27.250
Yes, you are.
I'm glad you're back.

00:27.250 --> 00:29.550
Where's Vichyssoise now?

00:30.010 --> 00:32.510
She's restrained and in the dungeon.

00:32.510 --> 00:35.990
One more thing:
I have a top-secret report.

00:37.090 --> 00:40.990
Vichyssoise has transformed into
a monstrous aberration, hasn't it?

00:41.600 --> 00:45.810
Yes, the Hydra family
must have known about this.

00:45.810 --> 00:47.490
In other words, the mastermind is...

00:47.960 --> 00:51.160
The Hydra family
has denied any involvement.

00:51.160 --> 00:53.670
They say that Vichyssoise acted alone

00:53.670 --> 00:57.830
and the explosion that targeted me
was a plot by the Zoa family.

00:57.830 --> 01:00.190
If we have conclusive evidence...

01:00.190 --> 01:03.760
...everything will be resolved
when Sisbell returns.

01:03.760 --> 01:06.200
- Have you had an audience with Shuvalts,
- When will Shuvalts come to the castle?

01:06.200 --> 01:07.590
- Mother?
- Alice.

01:07.590 --> 01:08.670
Huh?

01:09.080 --> 01:11.510
Alice, what did you say?

01:11.510 --> 01:15.210
But Sisbell said he's already arrived.

01:15.210 --> 01:17.220
Don't tell me he's not here.

01:19.850 --> 01:23.980
Your Majesty the Queen.
Oh, and Alice too.

01:24.440 --> 01:28.440
I've been looking for you.
I can't find you in your room.

01:30.290 --> 01:32.970
Has Sisbell's messenger arrived?

01:34.210 --> 01:35.640
How did you know that?!

01:36.120 --> 01:40.080
Do you know where Shuvalts is?

01:40.080 --> 01:41.640
No.

01:41.640 --> 01:46.880
But I think someone should go
for Sisbell as soon as possible.

01:47.590 --> 01:50.340
Do you think there is anyone
suitable for that?

01:52.180 --> 01:59.560
Of course. I'm going to go
get my cute little sister.

02:19.490 --> 02:25.630
OUR LAST CRUSADE OR THE RISE
OF A NEW WORLD SEASON 2

03:30.480 --> 03:36.490
EPISODE 4:
LINE OF DESCENT: MY NAME IS ELLETEAR

03:39.570 --> 03:41.410
I think it's heartache.

03:41.410 --> 03:46.330
I thought we could relax after defeating
that monster Vichyssoise...

03:46.330 --> 03:49.750
But Mr. Shuvalts is missing...

03:49.750 --> 03:52.550
That old man was supposed to get
an audience with the Queen

03:52.550 --> 03:55.260
and inform us of the safe route
to the castle.

03:55.720 --> 03:58.890
That was supposed to happen,
but he was intercepted.

04:02.320 --> 04:05.430
No, Sisbell! You must go to bed!

04:06.080 --> 04:08.980
I'm not in the mood to sleep...

04:11.270 --> 04:14.050
Even Shuvalts is being targeted...

04:14.050 --> 04:16.010
How despicable...

04:19.450 --> 04:23.080
I have to get back to the castle
as soon as possible...

04:23.080 --> 04:24.330
You can't!

04:24.330 --> 04:26.370
You still have a fever!

04:26.370 --> 04:29.600
I have to find the culprit...

04:29.600 --> 04:31.290
I know you want to hurry.

04:31.290 --> 04:34.380
But you have to trust us.

04:34.940 --> 04:37.270
We're going to get you home.

04:37.270 --> 04:38.760
We're almost there, right?

04:39.570 --> 04:40.720
Okay...

04:40.720 --> 04:44.290
That's why it's important
to take care of yourself.

04:44.290 --> 04:46.510
You haven't eaten since yesterday.

04:46.510 --> 04:50.060
When you recover enough to eat,
we'll go to the palace.

04:50.750 --> 04:53.080
Thank you for your concern.

04:53.080 --> 04:55.360
I'll have a meal.

04:55.360 --> 04:57.230
What do you want to eat?

04:57.650 --> 05:01.830
Warm, easy-to-eat, and nutritious food
that is gentle on the body

05:01.830 --> 05:05.790
and easy on the digestion.

05:05.790 --> 05:10.500
I would like a dish that is rich in flavor
and uses the best of the ingredients.

05:10.500 --> 05:12.080
Too many orders!

05:23.950 --> 05:26.810
This is the picture I took last year.

05:26.810 --> 05:29.060
And this is what I just took.

05:30.140 --> 05:33.150
Why?! They haven't grown at all!

05:33.760 --> 05:35.460
Let alone Lady Alice,

05:35.460 --> 05:39.190
at this rate,
it's only a matter of time before even

05:39.190 --> 05:41.130
the younger Lady Sisbell overtakes me!

05:47.640 --> 05:51.510
T-This embarrassing exercise...

05:51.510 --> 05:52.370
No!

05:54.010 --> 05:56.450
This is all for the sake
of my long-cherished wish!

05:59.590 --> 06:01.870
Ah! Y-Yes, Lady Alice?

06:01.870 --> 06:02.770
Rin.

06:02.770 --> 06:03.640
Tsk.

06:03.640 --> 06:05.510
So it's you, Imperial Swordsman.

06:05.510 --> 06:08.010
Your attitude is blatantly changing.

06:08.010 --> 06:11.100
What do you want?
I'm busy right now.

06:11.100 --> 06:12.350
Busy?

06:12.350 --> 06:15.410
What do you mean?
I'm just reporting in on time.

06:15.410 --> 06:17.970
Are you on an important mission?

06:18.440 --> 06:20.480
You could say that.

06:20.970 --> 06:25.640
I'm in the middle of a mission
where I can't afford to make any mistakes.

06:28.970 --> 06:31.140
Is she mixing something?

06:31.140 --> 06:33.290
What's that, Rin?

06:33.710 --> 06:35.330
Keep quiet.

06:35.330 --> 06:40.000
This is a top-secret concoction that
no one is allowed to know about.

06:40.450 --> 06:47.390
This will give me a destructive power
as powerful as Lady Alice herself.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.680
Destructive power?!

06:48.680 --> 06:49.600
Is that a bomb?

06:50.000 --> 06:52.980
They say it will take effect in 30 days.

06:52.980 --> 06:54.690
Only 30 days?!

06:54.690 --> 06:57.100
And that's two at the same time!

06:57.100 --> 07:01.690
Wait, Rin! Such destructive power
is not easy to get!

07:01.690 --> 07:03.870
What do you know about me?!

07:03.870 --> 07:07.620
Lady Alice's things are too big!

07:07.620 --> 07:10.830
Big? So that's what she means?

07:10.830 --> 07:14.330
I know it, Rin.
Alice's things are indeed big.

07:14.330 --> 07:15.850
See?

07:15.850 --> 07:20.800
I must follow her as a perfect follower.

07:20.800 --> 07:23.550
But Rin,

07:24.030 --> 07:26.600
she likes you just the way you are,
don't you think?

07:26.600 --> 07:28.180
What?

07:28.670 --> 07:32.140
Rin, I have a present for you!

07:32.140 --> 07:34.950
Look, it's the perfect size!

07:34.950 --> 07:36.440
Lady Alice,

07:36.440 --> 07:39.240
I will treasure this!

07:40.480 --> 07:43.900
But I can't stop now!

07:43.900 --> 07:45.400
Don't be hasty, Rin!

07:47.530 --> 07:50.510
Just what are you trying to do?!

07:54.200 --> 07:56.840
I-I-Imperial Swordsman?!

07:56.840 --> 07:57.830
Eek!

07:57.830 --> 08:01.460
Uh, what's the destructive power
you're talking about?

08:02.830 --> 08:07.240
Get out!

08:12.270 --> 08:14.960
What's wrong with her?

08:14.960 --> 08:17.550
Sisbell, your meal is ready.

08:21.310 --> 08:23.400
Can you walk to the dining table?

08:23.930 --> 08:27.410
Yes, I feel much better than before...

08:29.840 --> 08:32.620
It hurts!

08:32.620 --> 08:34.090
What?!

08:34.090 --> 08:36.270
Please carry me to the living room.

08:36.270 --> 08:37.660
O-Okay!

08:41.080 --> 08:44.090
Oh, my? What's wrong?

08:44.090 --> 08:45.210
It's nothing...

08:45.730 --> 08:49.220
Mine are already bigger than Rin, you know?

08:49.690 --> 08:51.510
You sound very energetic.

08:53.770 --> 08:54.970
Cough cough!

08:57.010 --> 08:57.730
Huh?

08:58.280 --> 09:00.240
The captain and others are on watch.

09:03.770 --> 09:05.320
Here.

09:06.250 --> 09:08.530
My hands are shaking,
and I cannot hold a spoon!

09:08.530 --> 09:10.840
Please feed me.

09:10.840 --> 09:12.850
But your hands were fine just now...

09:12.850 --> 09:14.530
Come on!

09:14.530 --> 09:16.200
O-Okay...

09:22.850 --> 09:25.040
It's my turn now.

09:25.500 --> 09:27.920
Iska, say "Aah."

09:27.920 --> 09:30.260
But you said you couldn't hold the spoon?

09:30.260 --> 09:32.760
The soup will get cold.

09:33.930 --> 09:36.350
Now... Come on...

09:37.140 --> 09:40.680
Wait! If this goes further,
your life is in danger!

09:40.680 --> 09:41.350
Huh?

09:41.350 --> 09:44.640
Anyway, just eat this!

09:48.650 --> 09:52.090
O stars, let me see your past.

09:53.830 --> 09:55.270
Is this footage?

09:55.270 --> 09:57.580
The holograms of the Empire
are also ghastly pale.

09:57.580 --> 09:59.660
Light Star Spirit.

10:00.040 --> 10:03.500
Past events can be reenacted as footage.

10:04.290 --> 10:07.170
However, there are certain
distance limitations.

10:08.010 --> 10:10.510
If you want to see the mastermind
behind the explosion,

10:10.510 --> 10:13.550
you have to go to the castle
where it happened.

10:13.550 --> 10:18.170
Yes. Vichyssoise must have
been sent for fear of that.

10:18.170 --> 10:22.550
She belongs to the Hydra family,
headed by the head of the family, Lord Talisman.

10:23.020 --> 10:26.200
In other words, the potential
mastermind is the Hydra family.

10:26.200 --> 10:27.150
Yes.

10:28.150 --> 10:30.990
They are the most important people
to be on the lookout for...

10:32.470 --> 10:34.570
...as we head for the Central Province.

10:35.070 --> 10:37.870
This is so sad, Mother.

10:38.370 --> 10:41.040
I just want to go pick up Sisbell,

10:41.040 --> 10:43.800
but you won't let me go outside.

10:44.490 --> 10:47.000
But I'm a bad girl.

10:47.530 --> 10:51.950
Going against what your parents say
really makes your heart race.

10:53.430 --> 10:58.350
Alice, I did indeed say
that I could count on you since you're here.

10:58.800 --> 11:02.770
But that doesn't mean I expect you
to sleep with me through the night.

11:02.770 --> 11:03.960
It's okay.

11:03.960 --> 11:06.130
Even if the culprit wants to attack again,

11:06.130 --> 11:08.360
I will protect you, Mother!

11:09.610 --> 11:12.290
Then I appreciate your concern.

11:12.290 --> 11:16.410
I'm more reliable than I was
when I was your age.

11:16.410 --> 11:17.990
T-That's not true...

11:20.400 --> 11:21.450
What's this?

11:23.670 --> 11:26.330
We were so close in those days.

11:26.330 --> 11:26.920
Huh?

11:28.290 --> 11:29.750
This photo...

11:29.750 --> 11:33.010
That was when I was in the Star Spirit Corps.

11:33.010 --> 11:36.800
It's the first time I saw your photo
when you were a princess, Mother.

11:39.930 --> 11:42.660
Salinger?! How?

11:42.660 --> 11:44.560
It's been an old fight between us.

11:45.370 --> 11:47.190
Now he is a notorious criminal.

11:47.190 --> 11:48.940
I can't recognize him as he used to be.

11:49.450 --> 11:52.230
Are you sure it's that Salinger?

11:52.650 --> 11:55.710
Salinger takes the Star Spirits of others.

11:55.710 --> 12:00.280
He targeted my Star Spirit,
and I turned it back on him.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.410
Over and over again.

12:02.410 --> 12:03.620
Over and over?

12:03.620 --> 12:06.010
Why didn't you capture him?

12:06.010 --> 12:08.160
It is a shame to capture him.

12:08.160 --> 12:10.550
That's what I thought.

12:10.550 --> 12:12.120
What do you mean?

12:12.120 --> 12:14.630
I wanted someone
I could really fight with.

12:14.630 --> 12:15.260
Huh?

12:15.670 --> 12:19.290
I wanted an opponent who would give
his all and meet my expectations.

12:19.290 --> 12:23.310
He was the strongest,
rudest, challenger,

12:23.310 --> 12:26.060
and rival that ever came before me.

12:26.950 --> 12:28.370
It's like me...

12:28.370 --> 12:31.590
Mother, I have the same feeling too.

12:31.590 --> 12:32.670
I...

12:32.670 --> 12:34.780
And that was a mistake.

12:35.190 --> 12:38.070
That man, in his quest for strength,

12:38.070 --> 12:40.430
attacked the previous queen

12:40.430 --> 12:43.120
in order to become
more powerful than her.

12:43.120 --> 12:46.250
I was the one who caught him.

12:47.070 --> 12:51.000
That man and I had a relationship
that transcended our positions

12:51.000 --> 12:53.690
as two people who wanted
to master the art of Star Spirits.

12:54.500 --> 12:57.380
But in the end...

12:57.890 --> 13:00.600
No, that's enough.

13:01.680 --> 13:06.310
Alice, did he say anything
to you at Alcatroz?

13:06.310 --> 13:08.140
Huh? Umm...

13:11.650 --> 13:13.790
Pardon me for calling you
at this late hour.

13:13.790 --> 13:17.820
Lady Sisbell has departed
on the night train to Central Province.

13:17.820 --> 13:21.450
The train will arrive in Central Province
tomorrow morning.

13:21.450 --> 13:24.150
Thanks for the report, Rin.

13:24.150 --> 13:27.610
I'll have Warvick and Kisasage
head to the terminal

13:27.610 --> 13:29.660
and meet you at Gate 4.

13:29.660 --> 13:31.040
Understood.

13:31.650 --> 13:33.890
Sisbell will be back.

13:33.890 --> 13:36.420
This will be the end of the case.

13:37.870 --> 13:40.550
Is this really the end?

13:45.250 --> 13:47.640
Fourth car on the next door, all clear.

13:48.090 --> 13:49.770
The second car, too.

13:49.770 --> 13:51.020
Hey, Jhin.

13:51.020 --> 13:52.980
The first car, too.

13:52.980 --> 13:54.860
Look at that.

13:54.860 --> 13:56.520
That's the Central Province.

13:56.970 --> 13:59.430
And that light.

14:01.380 --> 14:03.090
The Royal Palace...

14:06.410 --> 14:08.400
So this is the Central Province.

14:08.400 --> 14:10.430
We've finally arrived here.

14:11.240 --> 14:14.070
The queen's messenger
should be at the station.

14:14.590 --> 14:18.810
Our mission is to get you to a place
where the messenger can take you into custody.

14:18.810 --> 14:19.710
Right?

14:21.370 --> 14:23.220
The promised gift.

14:23.220 --> 14:25.250
I'll give it to you.

14:25.960 --> 14:28.190
A seal to conceal your star crest.

14:30.850 --> 14:33.710
But the escort is not over yet, you know?

14:33.710 --> 14:38.080
You change your attitude
the moment you receive your reward.

14:38.080 --> 14:41.670
I know you are not that kind of person.

14:42.850 --> 14:46.410
From here on out, it is my fight.

14:46.890 --> 14:51.590
Soon, we will arrive
at Terminal Sacraris Nebulica.

14:55.290 --> 14:59.330
It's such a big station,
but there are hardly any people.

14:59.330 --> 15:00.790
Is it because it's morning?

15:00.790 --> 15:03.690
It's too quiet.
I don't like it.

15:04.110 --> 15:05.680
This way.

15:07.050 --> 15:11.240
The queen's messenger
is waiting at Gate 4 ahead.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.100
Over there.

15:16.520 --> 15:18.980
- I'm sorry. I didn't see you...
- My, my.

15:19.560 --> 15:22.150
You mustn't look the other way, Sisbell.

15:22.150 --> 15:25.160
Wow, what a beautiful person.

15:25.160 --> 15:27.240
You're right.
Who is she?

15:28.400 --> 15:31.930
Elletear... Big sister.

15:32.700 --> 15:33.660
What?!

15:34.920 --> 15:37.570
Welcome home, Sisbell.

15:37.570 --> 15:39.630
I was worried about you.

15:40.760 --> 15:42.450
Worried?

15:43.190 --> 15:47.510
The Queen's messenger is supposed
to be here to pick me up. Why are you here?

15:47.510 --> 15:49.760
Why you ask?

15:49.760 --> 15:54.470
I think it's natural for a big sister
to worry about her lovely little sister.

15:55.370 --> 15:58.870
My name is Elletear,
sister of Sisbell.

15:58.870 --> 16:01.190
Welcome to our country.

16:01.800 --> 16:06.530
I've heard that you are members of the armed
forces of the independent state of Alsamira.

16:06.530 --> 16:09.620
That's right.
We were hired there.

16:09.620 --> 16:10.820
Well...

16:10.820 --> 16:15.870
I thought it was the former Saint Disciple Iska
and his troops from the Imperial Guard.

16:16.660 --> 16:20.440
Big sister, what are you saying?

16:20.440 --> 16:22.250
These people...

16:22.680 --> 16:25.730
It'll be a problem if the Queen
finds out about this.

16:26.790 --> 16:30.680
I did not expect that you could be
friendly with the Imperial Army.

16:31.510 --> 16:33.680
I-I'm not!

16:33.680 --> 16:38.480
Wouldn't you all be in trouble
if the Imperial Command knew

16:38.480 --> 16:41.770
that the Imperial Guard
was the witch's bodyguard?

16:45.090 --> 16:48.960
Your guards can no longer be against me.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.700
You are mine.

16:53.080 --> 16:54.910
What do you want?

16:55.770 --> 16:58.870
It's to thank you
for saving my little sister.

16:58.870 --> 17:04.290
I want to take you all
on a vacation to Lou's family villa.

17:04.290 --> 17:09.130
A prison that you called a villa.
And a vacation called surveillance, huh?

17:09.130 --> 17:11.490
Of course, there will be hearings too.

17:11.490 --> 17:14.870
If everything is all right,
we will return you to the Empire.

17:14.870 --> 17:17.930
That's good, isn't it, Sisbell?

17:19.200 --> 17:21.770
T-That's...

17:22.190 --> 17:26.310
That's right!
You can stay at the villa.

17:26.760 --> 17:30.290
N-No! I'll stay at the palace!

17:30.290 --> 17:32.130
You can't.

17:32.130 --> 17:34.830
Big sister! What are you doing?

17:34.830 --> 17:38.330
We're going to
the Lou family's villa together.

17:38.330 --> 17:40.810
It's been a long time
since we've been together.

17:40.810 --> 17:42.420
Aren't you excited?

17:42.420 --> 17:45.090
She's taking the Imperial Guard
to the Lou family's villa?

17:46.110 --> 17:50.130
Lady Elletear, I really suspect you.

17:52.380 --> 17:55.430
Mother! Big sister Elletear
is at Sisbell's place!

17:55.430 --> 17:56.930
I've heard about that.

17:56.930 --> 17:59.910
Alice, hurry to the villa.

17:59.910 --> 18:03.440
Protect Sisbell and bring
her back to the castle.

18:03.910 --> 18:07.650
I have forbidden Elletear to go out.

18:08.370 --> 18:09.840
Yes.

18:09.840 --> 18:11.850
I never thought that big sister...

18:12.840 --> 18:17.790
The four guards hired by Sisbell
should also be invited to the villa.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.790
They are from another country,
so please be polite.

18:20.790 --> 18:23.350
As for the guards, that should...

18:23.350 --> 18:24.580
This is bad!

18:25.200 --> 18:26.170
Alice?

18:26.170 --> 18:30.830
That's right, Iska will be
in the Lou family's villa.

18:32.280 --> 18:33.090
If Iska looked into my room,

18:33.090 --> 18:36.110
IT'S ALICE'S IMAGINATION
If Iska looked into my room,

18:36.110 --> 18:36.510
IT'S ALICE'S IMAGINATION

18:36.510 --> 18:38.290
ALICE'S ROOM
he'd find a secret pair of underwear

18:38.290 --> 18:41.600
ALICE'S ROOM
in my closet that I bought out of curiosity!

18:41.600 --> 18:43.810
A-Amazing!

18:44.280 --> 18:47.970
Even though it's from the fabric,
it stretches and shrinks,

18:47.970 --> 18:50.090
and the feel is superb!

18:50.090 --> 18:55.470
I never thought that my sister would be
wearing such shameful underwear!

18:55.470 --> 18:57.760
What do you think, Iska?

18:58.830 --> 19:02.570
What a pity.
I've been wrong about you, Alice.

19:03.610 --> 19:08.320
I was attracted by your
innocence and purity.

19:08.320 --> 19:10.090
But I never imagined...

19:10.090 --> 19:14.840
...that you were fighting on the battlefield
wearing such shameful underwear!

19:14.840 --> 19:16.550
You're wrong!

19:16.550 --> 19:19.810
I wear a different one on the battlefield!

19:19.810 --> 19:21.710
We must stop this, Mother.

19:21.710 --> 19:26.230
I will definitely stop what
big sister Elletear is up to.

19:26.770 --> 19:28.150
I'm counting on you.

19:28.150 --> 19:32.070
Elletear must be hiding a secret after all.

19:32.070 --> 19:34.950
Yes. This is to protect my secret!

19:34.950 --> 19:35.740
Huh?

19:36.210 --> 19:39.520
It's nothing! I'm off!

19:40.440 --> 19:42.810
Alice, one last thing.

19:42.810 --> 19:44.080
Mother?

19:44.590 --> 19:46.130
By this time next year,

19:46.130 --> 19:51.010
you will have replaced me
as the queen of this hall.

19:51.760 --> 19:52.670
Eh?

19:55.200 --> 20:00.260
The country is currently in turmoil
due to an explosion

20:00.260 --> 20:02.810
targeting the Queen.

20:03.370 --> 20:09.120
Your mission is to take advantage of this
and surprise the Royal Palace of Nebulis.

20:10.060 --> 20:12.470
THE 10TH SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:
Oh, wonderful!

20:12.470 --> 20:14.550
OMEN
The Imperial Star Crest Inspection!

20:14.550 --> 20:17.290
NEWTON (SICKLIEST RESEARCHER)
I never thought I would experience it myself!

20:18.160 --> 20:20.240
Where's Director Magnacasa?

20:20.240 --> 20:21.760
THE 11TH SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:
He's in charge of operations in the Empire.

20:21.760 --> 20:23.310
ABSENT ENGINEER
He's in charge of operations in the Empire.

20:23.310 --> 20:25.630
GARUGANRYI
And you've been talking too loud.

20:25.630 --> 20:27.080
And you've been talking too loud.

20:27.080 --> 20:29.840
Oh, excuse me.

20:31.150 --> 20:36.720
Now, Mei and Nameless should be arriving
in the Central Province right now.

20:37.160 --> 20:40.760
The Royal Palace is divided into four areas:
the palace of the queen

20:40.760 --> 20:45.850
and the surrounding areas of
Lou, Zoa, and Hydra.

20:45.850 --> 20:50.150
They will be deployed as soon
as they arrive in the Central Province.

20:51.530 --> 20:53.770
Our main target is the Queen,

20:53.770 --> 20:57.330
but we expect to engage
the other Purebreds as well.

20:57.330 --> 20:59.520
We will hunt them all down.

20:59.520 --> 21:01.570
It's been a while since I've worked with you,

21:01.570 --> 21:02.490
THE 8TH SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:
It's been a while since I've worked with you,

21:02.490 --> 21:03.200
INVISIBLE HAND OF GOD
Nameless.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.120
NAMELESS
Nameless.

21:04.120 --> 21:05.670
THE 3RD SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:

21:05.670 --> 21:06.670
THE INCESSANT TEMPEST
The fun witch hunt is just around the corner.

21:06.670 --> 21:07.660
MEI
The fun witch hunt is just around the corner.

21:07.660 --> 21:08.290
The fun witch hunt is just around the corner.

21:10.440 --> 21:12.730
The head of the A class is the Queen,

21:12.730 --> 21:15.630
the B class is the head
of the Zoa family, Growley,

21:16.190 --> 21:18.800
and the C class is the Zoa family, Kissing,

21:18.800 --> 21:21.400
and the Ice Calamity Witch, Aliceliese.

21:22.280 --> 21:26.370
And yet, the Hydra family
is the only one not targeted for attack.

21:27.970 --> 21:31.790
It's obvious who has been in league
with the Eight Great Apostles.

21:33.250 --> 21:34.480
I can see it.

21:34.960 --> 21:37.000
The Royal Palace of Nebulis

21:37.000 --> 21:41.610
is the impregnable fortress and absolute
defense line of the witches.

21:42.190 --> 21:45.160
Now let's see how we can destroy it.

21:46.280 --> 21:49.200
Show them the true power
of the Saint Disciples.

21:49.610 --> 21:51.490
Capture the Queen

21:51.490 --> 21:55.280
and end this war with
a victory for the Empire.

21:56.630 --> 21:58.960
All units have passed the border.

21:59.490 --> 22:02.130
They will arrive here tomorrow.

22:02.130 --> 22:02.840
THE 5TH SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:

22:02.840 --> 22:05.410
RISYA IN EMPIRE
Johaim, aren't you strangely accustomed

22:05.410 --> 22:07.180
RISYA
to wearing imperial attire?

22:07.630 --> 22:08.770
I don't know.

22:09.170 --> 22:14.240
Was it the Queen you were after?
You must be careful at best.

22:14.240 --> 22:19.530
There's that Ice Calamity Witch
by the queen's side at the peak.

22:19.530 --> 22:20.440
She's not there.

22:20.440 --> 22:21.360
What?

22:21.360 --> 22:24.050
THE 1ST SEAT OF THE SAINT DISCIPLES:
The Ice Calamity Witch is leaving the palace.

22:24.050 --> 22:24.690
THE FLASH KNIGHT

22:24.690 --> 22:26.240
JOHAIM
The Queen...

22:26.240 --> 22:28.560
...is the only one in the castle now.
